abstract: >
  Aerosol Studio is an interactive Python and Bokeh application for atmospheric
  aerosol particle size distribution visualization, ROI-based analysis, fitting,
  growth-rate exploration, and reproducible GUI analysis sessions.
keywords:
  - aerosol science
  - atmospheric measurements
  - particle size distribution
  - new particle formation
  - NetCDF
  - CSV
  - Bokeh
